From 21f3bb8fdf0db968d2e242976678154ddc5260d2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Onur Demir <demir-onur@hotmail.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 23:35:34 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 13/22] nginx_legacy_sync: scope=upstreams|locations|all -
 upstream duzeltmesi ile location esitleme ayri kosturulabilir

- upstreams: yalniz FQDN->upstream + eksik upstream tanimi (sablon / eslenikten)
- locations: yalniz location kumesi esitleme; all: ikisi (varsayilan)
- playbook assert + rapor 'kapsam' satiri; README 2a + ornek; test 10

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
